  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Self Help Groups in Makwanpur district, Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To explore is the establishment of self-help groups which have proven effective in providing poor communities with low-budget, self-organised options for financial services. Through the mobilization of vulnerable groups to self-help, their regular meetings and the inbuilt capacity building, these groups also have the potential to empower vulnerable groups and promote their political engagement</narrative>
  </description>
